    {
      "timestamp": 1785593616750,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "architecture",
      "content": "WIP (unstaged, main branch): Setup Wizard onboarding + desacoplar Google OAuth do login.\n- SetupWizardModal.vue (novo, 673 linhas): wizard 6 passos (Empresa/Endereço/Contatos/Visual/Integrações/Revisão), reusa SettingsCompany/Address/Contact/Visual. Salva via POST /api/profile/setup-wizard.\n- OnboardingController.vue: wizard tem prioridade sobre welcome tour; só mostra welcome apos profile.setupWizardCompleted=true.\n- server/api/auth/google.get.ts: removidos escopos calendar/drive e access_type=offline/prompt=consent do login OAuth basico (login so pede profile+email agora).\n- server/api/integrations/google/connect.get.ts: NOVO fluxo dedicado p/ conectar Google c/ escopos calendar.events+drive.file+userinfo.email, gera state CSRF em cookie httpOnly.\n- server/api/integrations/google/callback.get.ts: valida CSRF state, troca code por tokens, faz $set do objeto googleIntegration inteiro (evita erro Mongo \"Cannot create field in null\").\n- server/api/integrations/google/disconnect.post.ts (novo): limpa tokens mas mantem email.\n- server/api/profile/setup-wizard.post.ts (novo): valida com zod, seta setupWizardCompleted=true.\n- types/index.ts + Profile.ts: novos campos setupWizardCompleted, driveReportsFolderId. \n- INCONSISTENCIA: types/index.ts usa \"onboardingSkippedAt\" mas Profile.ts (mongoose schema) usa \"setupWizardSkippedAt\" — nomes divergentes, checar antes de usar.\n- INCONSISTENCIA: disconnect.post.ts nao limpa driveReportsFolderId (só driveFolderId e driveProposalsFolderId) mesmo campo existindo no schema."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": 1785593634866,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "env",
      "content": "Worktrees antigos dirty existem em .claude/worktrees/feat/quick-wins e fix/security-and-quality (uncommitted changes locais, nao relacionado ao trabalho atual). Historico recente main: FIX x3, FIX NOTIFICATION CENTRAL, badges score comercial/relatorios, prompt IA analise comercial. Foco atual do dir principal: onboarding Setup Wizard + Google OAuth separation (ver nota architecture)."
    }
